2. Linear Voltage Regulator Alternatives: LM317AEMP vs. Standard LM317 vs. LM1117

The LM317AEMP is an advanced, high-precision version of the classic LM317 adjustable regulator housed in a surface-mount SOT-223 package. Standard LM317 components or Low-Dropout (LDO) regulators like the LM1117 are common alternatives. [1] (https://www.digikey.com/en/products/detail/texas-instruments/LM317AEMP-NOPB/363903)

